  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 10 new plugins and 87 stars on the official repo, alongside a 0.2.0-rc.1 release; dataelement/dsh-desktop led growth at +40 stars. However, 12,973 of 16,491 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days, leaving a health score of 37 — watch activity, not just totals.",
